WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.630
In y equals m x plus c,

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:08.240
c is where it crosses the y axis. Here, one.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.350
m is the slope: one step right, two steps up.

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.740
So this line is y equals two x plus one.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.350
A bigger m makes it steeper.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.200
A bigger c lifts it up.

